{"id":"2b2d439bc6f41eb9","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/628_博弈模态逻辑.md","title":"628 博弈模态逻辑","display":"628_博弈模态逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{g_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{g_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>博弈项构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{gat},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{choice},\\quad \\operatorname{dual}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{gat},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{choice},\\quad \\operatorname{dual}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{dia}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{dia}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma;\\delta=\\operatorname{seq}(\\gamma,\\delta),\\quad\n\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta=\\operatorname{choice}(\\gamma,\\delta),\\quad\n\\gamma^d=\\operatorname{dual}(\\gamma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma;\\delta=\\operatorname{seq}(\\gamma,\\delta),\\quad\n\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta=\\operatorname{choice}(\\gamma,\\delta),\\quad\n\\gamma^d=\\operatorname{dual}(\\gamma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A=\\operatorname{dia}(\\gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A=\\operatorname{dia}(\\gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\gamma]A=\\neg\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\neg A,\\quad\n\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\gamma]A=\\neg\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\neg A,\\quad\n\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-博弈项与公式\">2. 博弈项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\">\\(\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{gat}(g)\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\">\\(\\operatorname{gat}(g)\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\">\\(\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma;\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\">\\(\\gamma;\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\">\\(\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\">\\(\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^d\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\">\\(\\gamma^d\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>博弈项不含命题变元。公式自由变元函数满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{628}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{628}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{628}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{628}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{628}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>博弈项不含命题变元，定义博弈项替换恒等函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}:\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{628}\\to\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}:\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{628}\\to\\mathsf{Game}_{628}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\operatorname{gat}(g),\\sigma)=\\operatorname{gat}(g),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\operatorname{gat}(g),\\sigma)=\\operatorname{gat}(g),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma;\\delta,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma,\\sigma);\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\delta,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma;\\delta,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma,\\sigma);\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\delta,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma,\\sigma)\\sqcup\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\delta,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma,\\sigma)\\sqcup\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\delta,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma^d,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma,\\sigma)^d.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma^d,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{GSub}_{628}(\\gamma,\\sigma)^d.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{628}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{628}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{628}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{628}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A)=\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A)=\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,628}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,628}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{628}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{628}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{628}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{628}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{628}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{628}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>博弈模态公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{628}=\\{[\\gamma](A\\to B)\\to([\\gamma]A\\to[\\gamma]B):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{628}=\\{[\\gamma](A\\to B)\\to([\\gamma]A\\to[\\gamma]B):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{628}=\\{\\langle\\gamma;\\delta\\rangle A\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\langle\\delta\\rangle A:\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{628}=\\{\\langle\\gamma;\\delta\\rangle A\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\langle\\delta\\rangle A:\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Choice}^{628}=\\{\\langle\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta\\rangle A\\leftrightarrow(\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A\\lor\\langle\\delta\\rangle A):\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Choice}^{628}=\\{\\langle\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta\\rangle A\\leftrightarrow(\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A\\lor\\langle\\delta\\rangle A):\\gamma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{628}=\\{\\langle\\gamma^d\\rangle A\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\neg A:\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{628}=\\{\\langle\\gamma^d\\rangle A\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\neg A:\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{628}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{628}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Choice}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{628}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{628}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{628}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Seq}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Choice}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dual}^{628}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{628}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{628}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecGame}^{628}=\\{((A),[\\gamma]A):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecGame}^{628}=\\{((A),[\\gamma]A):\\gamma\\in\\mathsf{Game}_{628},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{628}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecGame}^{628}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{628}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{628}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecGame}^{628}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span>。证明对象集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{628}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{628}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 由所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span> 组成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\)</span>。每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{628}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{628}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{628}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{628}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecGame}^{628}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecGame}^{628}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{628}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{628}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{628}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{628}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，其中有证明行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta_i,A)\">\\((\\Delta_i,A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{628}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{628}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{628}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{628}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-博弈模态语义\">9. 博弈模态语义</h1>\n<p>博弈模态模型为三元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(S,V,(R_g)_{g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}})\\in\\mathsf{GMod}_{628},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(S,V,(R_g)_{g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}})\\in\\mathsf{GMod}_{628},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(S\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_g\\subseteq S\\times S\">\\(R_g\\subseteq S\\times S\\)</span>。对每个博弈项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 与目标集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span>，定义胜出算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma,X)\\subseteq S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma,X)\\subseteq S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\operatorname{gat}(g),X)\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\exists t\\in X\\ (s,t)\\in R_g\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\operatorname{gat}(g),X)\n=\n\\{s\\in S:\\exists t\\in X\\ (s,t)\\in R_g\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma;\\delta,X)\n=\n\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma,\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\delta,X)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma;\\delta,X)\n=\n\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma,\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\delta,X)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta,X)\n=\n\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma,X)\\cup\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\delta,X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta,X)\n=\n\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma,X)\\cup\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\delta,X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma^d,X)\n=\nS\\setminus\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma,S\\setminus X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma^d,X)\n=\nS\\setminus\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma,S\\setminus X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{GMod}_{628}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{GMod}_{628}\\)</span>，解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{628}\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}=S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}=(S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}=S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}=(S\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\operatorname{Win}_{628}^{\\mathcal M}(\\gamma,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\gamma]A\">\\([\\gamma]A\\)</span> 作为缩写出现，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket[\\gamma]A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\nS\\setminus\\llbracket\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\neg A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket[\\gamma]A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\nS\\setminus\\llbracket\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\neg A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{628}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{628}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\ns\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{628}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{628}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(S,V,(R_g)_{g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}})\\in\\mathsf{GMod}_{628}\\ \\forall s\\in S\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{628}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{628}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{628}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(S,V,(R_g)_{g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}})\\in\\mathsf{GMod}_{628}\\ \\forall s\\in S\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{628}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,s\\Vdash_{628}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统的目标差异是博弈项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma;\\delta\">\\(\\gamma;\\delta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta\">\\(\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^d\">\\(\\gamma^d\\)</span> 与公式模态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A\">\\(\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A\\)</span> 同时作为句法对象出现，并有序列、选择、对偶的显式公理族；第 9 节用胜出算子统一解释这些博弈项。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{GML}_{628}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{GAtom},\\mathsf{Game}_{628},\\mathsf{Frm}_{628},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{628},\\operatorname{BV}_{628},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{628},\\operatorname{GSub}_{628},\\operatorname{Sub}_{628},\\equiv_{\\alpha,628},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{628},\\mathsf{Rule}_{628},\\mathsf{Proof}_{628},\\vdash_{628},\\mathsf{Thm}_{628},\n\\mathsf{GMod}_{628},\\operatorname{Win}_{628},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{628},\\Vdash_{628},\\models_{628}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{GML}_{628}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{GAtom},\\mathsf{Game}_{628},\\mathsf{Frm}_{628},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{628},\\operatorname{BV}_{628},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{628},\\operatorname{GSub}_{628},\\operatorname{Sub}_{628},\\equiv_{\\alpha,628},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{628},\\mathsf{Rule}_{628},\\mathsf{Proof}_{628},\\vdash_{628},\\mathsf{Thm}_{628},\n\\mathsf{GMod}_{628},\\operatorname{Win}_{628},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{628},\\Vdash_{628},\\models_{628}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由博弈项、博弈模态公式、公理、证明关系以及博弈模态语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>本条目不在此处断言可靠性、完备性、策略合成或模型检查算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-博弈项与公式","text":"2. 博弈项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-博弈模态语义","text":"9. 博弈模态语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{g_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{gat},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{choice},\\quad \\operatorname{dual}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{dia}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma;\\delta=\\operatorname{seq}(\\gamma,\\delta),\\quad\n\\gamma\\sqcup\\delta=\\operatorname{choice}(\\gamma,\\delta),\\quad\n\\gamma^d=\\operatorname{dual}(\\gamma),","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle\\gamma\\rangle A=\\operatorname{dia}(\\gamma,A).","display":true},{"tex":"[\\gamma]A=\\neg\\langle\\gamma\\rangle\\neg A,\\quad\n\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Game}_{628}","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}","display":fa